{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-038",
    "title": "归墟开门"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_241",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "守门：由宗门决定。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "倒置城翻转之后，地底空洞露出一条新的通道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6904,
          "end": 6904
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "通道向上延伸，尽头却不是天空，而是一片被灰雾遮住的灯海。无数灯柱从石壁中探出，灯火大多熄灭，只有最深处一盏微弱地亮着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6906,
          "end": 6906
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“最后一盏引路灯。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6908,
          "end": 6908
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的声音很轻，像是早已在某份家族账本中见过这个名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6910,
          "end": 6910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向顾氏旧印：“那盏灯不是顾氏的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6912,
          "end": 6912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“但顾氏有点亮它的方法。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6914,
          "end": 6914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6916,
          "end": 6916
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有回答。她从袖中取出三枚铜针，分别刺入自己的指尖、腕骨和心口。血沿针身流下，在地面画出一条完整的顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6918,
          "end": 6918
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抓住她的手：“你要做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6920,
          "end": 6920
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把债还到我这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6922,
          "end": 6922
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不是你的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6924,
          "end": 6924
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏把灯交给了我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6926,
          "end": 6926
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你可以拒绝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6928,
          "end": 6928
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经拒绝过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6930,
          "end": 6930
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她看向倒置城。城中那些被削平的名字正在一盏盏亮起，许多模糊的影子沿通道向上走来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6932,
          "end": 6932
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这次我想自己决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6934,
          "end": 6934
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻走到她身边：“点灯之后，你的修行根基会被用作灯芯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6936,
          "end": 6936
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会失去修为？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6938,
          "end": 6938
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“从此无法再凝聚新的灵气。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6940,
          "end": 6940
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“你还可以停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6942,
          "end": 6942
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头看他：“你已经结丹了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6944,
          "end": 6944
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不代表你必须付出代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6946,
          "end": 6946
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人点灯，所有人都要付出。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6948,
          "end": 6948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她拔出心口铜针，血珠没有落地，反而沿着地面旧印流向灯海深处。每经过一座熄灭的灯柱，便有一个名字从石壁中浮出。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6950,
          "end": 6950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临听见无数陌生人低声说话。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6952,
          "end": 6952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6954,
          "end": 6954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不想再回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6956,
          "end": 6956
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我的孩子在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6958,
          "end": 6958
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别替我决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6960,
          "end": 6960
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一盏灯的灯罩缓缓转向顾长离。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6962,
          "end": 6962
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内没有灯芯，只有一道顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6964,
          "end": 6964
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把手放上去。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6966,
          "end": 6966
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前走。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6968,
          "end": 6968
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临挡在她面前：“我可以用残印替你点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6970,
          "end": 6970
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经替很多人承担。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6972,
          "end": 6972
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还承受得住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6974,
          "end": 6974
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你承受的是忘记。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6976,
          "end": 6976
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她伸手按住他的胸口：“我不想看着你连自己都忘掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6978,
          "end": 6978
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离绕过他，将手掌按在灯罩上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6980,
          "end": 6980
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一盏引路灯没有立刻亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6982,
          "end": 6982
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离闭上眼，开始念顾氏家族的旧账。她念出每一名经手人的姓名、每一盏灯的去向、每一笔被改写的日期。念到最后，她的声音开始颤抖。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6984,
          "end": 6984
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支第七代，顾长离。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6986,
          "end": 6986
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内浮出她的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6988,
          "end": 6988
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“未偿债一笔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6990,
          "end": 6990
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名字下方出现黑色印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6992,
          "end": 6992
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“自愿点灯，承担后果。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6994,
          "end": 6994
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离睁开眼：“我愿意。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6996,
          "end": 6996
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "黑色印记瞬间碎裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6998,
          "end": 6998
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“债已归还，修行止于此。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7024,
          "end": 7024
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看着最后一盏灯：“它现在照向哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7026,
          "end": 7026
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯火穿过通道，照向地底空洞上方的天门裂缝。裂缝中的黑暗被黄色灯光切开，露出一条通往人间的路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7028,
          "end": 7028
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见陆沉舟站在路的另一端。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7030,
          "end": 7030
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，父亲的脸仍然清晰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7032,
          "end": 7032
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离替你点了灯。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7034,
          "end": 7034
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她会怎样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7036,
          "end": 7036
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她不能再修行，却能比修士走得更远。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7038,
          "end": 7038
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你为什么不回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7040,
          "end": 7040
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟看向灯海：“我回来，门就会关。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7042,
          "end": 7042
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我替你留在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7044,
          "end": 7044
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经有自己的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7046,
          "end": 7046
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“路是灯照出来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7048,
          "end": 7048
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟摇头：“灯只照见脚下，路要自己走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7050,
          "end": 7050
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门裂缝忽然扩大，黄色灯光被吸向其中。最后一盏引路灯开始倾斜，像即将被门内的风吹灭。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7052,
          "end": 7052
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬起没有灵气的手，按住灯座。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7054,
          "end": 7054
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还没允许你熄灭。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7056,
          "end": 7056
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7082,
          "end": 7082
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋从裂口另一侧走来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7218,
          "end": 7218
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她披着雪色斗篷，手里提着已经熄灭的第三盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7220,
          "end": 7220
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是一个曾经替你们点灯的人。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7222,
          "end": 7222
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老后退：“你不该活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7224,
          "end": 7224
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我活着，所以你们的证词才有意义。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7226,
          "end": 7226
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把第三盏灯放在改写台上。灯罩内没有火，却映出三年前雪原的景象：陆沉舟把灯交给她，顾氏经手人站在一旁，归墟盟旧使者正在撕毁姓名纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7228,
          "end": 7228
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方同时看见自己的过去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7230,
          "end": 7230
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主脸色变得难看：“关掉它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7232,
          "end": 7232
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们不是想要改写权吗？”沈砚秋问，“先让门看见谁在改写。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7234,
          "end": 7234
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯自行亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7236,
          "end": 7236
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "改写台上的三列文字同时变清晰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7238,
          "end": 7238
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门：由宗门决定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7240,
          "end": 7240
        }
      }
    ],
